# Angel Team Figure Skating School Website

A modern, responsive website for Angel Team - Figure Skating and Hockey School built with Vue.js 3, featuring multilingual support, booking system, and comprehensive content management.

## 🌟 Features

- **Multilingual Support**: English and Russian with automatic browser detection
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first approach with beautiful animations
- **Modern UI/UX**: Clean, professional design with sporty aesthetics
- **Booking System**: Complete booking form with EmailJS integration
- **Content Management**: JSON-based CMS for easy content updates
- **Interactive Components**: Dynamic schedules, coach profiles, and product catalog
- **Performance Optimized**: Fast loading and smooth user experience

## 🚀 Technology Stack

- **Frontend Framework**: Vue.js 3 with Composition API
- **Build Tool**: Vite
- **Styling**: Custom CSS with CSS Variables
- **Routing**: Vue Router 4
- **Internationalization**: Vue I18n
- **Email Integration**: EmailJS
- **Content Management**: JSON files

## 📁 Project Structure

```
angel-team-figure-skating/
├── index.html                 # Main HTML file
├── package.json              # Project dependencies
├── vite.config.js            # Vite configuration
├── src/
│   ├── main.js              # Application entry point
│   ├── App.vue              # Root Vue component
│   ├── assets/
│   │   └── css/
│   │       └── main.css     # Main stylesheet
│   ├── components/          # Reusable components
│   │   ├── AppHeader.vue    # Navigation header
│   │   └── AppFooter.vue    # Site footer
│   ├── views/               # Page components
│   │   ├── Home.vue         # Homepage
│   │   ├── Coaches.vue      # Coaching staff
│   │   ├── CoachProfile.vue # Individual coach profiles
│   │   ├── Schedule.vue     # Training schedule
│   │   ├── Booking.vue      # Booking system
│   │   ├── Prices.vue       # Pricing information
│   │   ├── Shop.vue         # Merchandise store
│   │   ├── Reviews.vue      # Student reviews
│   │   └── Contacts.vue     # Contact information
│   ├── services/
│   │   └── contentService.js # Data loading service
│   ├── router.js            # Vue Router configuration
│   └── i18n.js              # Internationalization setup
├── content/                  # Content management files
│   ├── coaches.json         # Coach information
│   ├── schedule.json        # Training schedules
│   ├── prices.json          # Pricing data
│   └── shop.json           # Product catalog
└── public/                  # Static assets (to be added)
```

## 🎨 Design System

### Color Palette
- **Primary Black**: #000000 (Main text)
- **Primary White**: #FFFFFF (Background)
- **Accent Red**: #FF3366 (Buttons, highlights)
- **Dark Gray**: #2D2D2D (Footer, dark blocks)
- **Light Gray**: #F8F8F8 (Background blocks)
- **Medium Gray**: #E5E5E5 (Borders)
- **Text Gray**: #666666 (Secondary text)

### Typography
- **Headings**: Montserrat (Bold/ExtraBold)
- **Body Text**: Roboto (Light/Regular)
- **Navigation**: Open Sans (Medium)

### Font Hierarchy
- **H1**: 72-84px (ExtraBold)
- **H2**: 36-42px (Bold)
- **H3**: 24-28px (Medium)
- **H4**: 20-24px (Medium)
- **Body**: 16-18px (Regular)
- **Small**: 14px (Light)

## 🛠️ Installation & Setup

1. **Clone the repository** (if applicable)
2. **Install dependencies**:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
3. **Start development server**:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```
4. **Build for production**:
   ```bash
   npm run build
   ```

## 📱 Responsive Design

### Breakpoints
- **Mobile**: 320px - 768px
- **Tablet**: 768px - 1024px
- **Desktop**: 1024px+

### Mobile Features
- Hamburger navigation menu
- Touch-friendly interactive elements
- Optimized form layouts
- Compressed image placeholders

## 🌍 Internationalization

### Supported Languages
- **English (en)**: Default language
- **Russian (ru)**: Full translation support

### Language Detection
- Automatic browser language detection
- Manual language switcher in header
- Local storage preference saving

### Key Translations
- Navigation menu items
- Hero section content
- Call-to-action buttons
- Form labels and validation

## 📅 Content Management

### Coaches (`content/coaches.json`)
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Coach Name",
  "position": "Position",
  "specialization": "Specialization",
  "photo": "images/coaches/coach.jpg",
  "biography": ["Achievement 1", "Achievement 2"],
  "schedule": { "monday": ["10:00-11:00"], "tuesday": [] },
  "locations": ["TRK RAY", "TRK OKEANIS"]
}
```

### Schedule (`content/schedule.json`)
```json
{
  "venues": {
    "TRK RAY": {
      "name": "TRK RAY",
      "address": "Nizhny Novgorod",
      "schedule": {
        "children": { "monday": ["11:15-12:15"] },
        "adults": { "monday": ["14:30-15:30"] }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Pricing (`content/prices.json`)
```json
{
  "programs": [
    {
      "name": "Individual Training",
      "pricing": { "single": 1500, "package": 600 },
      "unit": "₽"
    }
  ]
}
```

## 🛒 Booking System

### Features
- **Coach Selection**: Specific coach or any available
- **Location Choice**: Dynamic based on coach selection
- **Date & Time**: Interactive calendar and time slots
- **Client Information**: Required and optional fields
- **Additional Options**: Group training preferences

### Form Validation
- Required field validation
- Email format validation
- Phone number format validation
- Form submission feedback

### Email Integration
- EmailJS integration for form submissions
- Structured email content
- Error handling and success messages

## 🛍️ Shop System

### Product Features
- **Categories**: Costumes, Apparel, Accessories
- **Variants**: Sizes and colors for applicable items
- **Cart Functionality**: Add to cart, quantity management
- **Order Process**: Contact information collection

### Product Structure
```json
{
  "name": "Product Name",
  "price": 2700,
  "currency": "₽",
  "sizes": ["XS", "S", "M", "L", "XL"],
  "colors": ["White", "Black", "Navy", "Gray"]
}
```

